---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Community"
  description="The SIRYUS community: creatives, mentors, and collaborators."
>
  <h1>Community</h1>
  <p class="marketing-lede">Independent voices, shared stages, and long-term relationships.</p>
  <img
    src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517245386807-bb43f82c33c4?w=1200&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop"
    alt="People collaborating"
    width="1200"
    height="675"
    loading="lazy"
    style="width: 100%; max-height: 360px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 12px; margin: 1rem 0 1.5rem;"
  />
  <p>We grow through mentorship, projects, and honest conversation. Follow updates on <a href="/blog">the blog</a> and reach out via <a href="/contact">contact</a>.</p>
</BaseLayout>
